{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Microwaves. Everyone has one. Most people use them to reheat sad leftovers. You are NOT most people. We want\u00a0COMEDY, EXPLOSIONS, CHAOS, AND MAYHEM!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921590/extras/31bc01a5babaa10f94bb61d9aebe73e5.poster.avif?t=1770592440\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921590/extras/31bc01a5babaa10f94bb61d9aebe73e5.webm?t=1770592440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921590/extras/31bc01a5babaa10f94bb61d9aebe73e5.mp4?t=1770592440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your cozy little <i><strong>sandbox</strong></i> of a home is a fully operational microwave-powered business.\u00a0Cook, Sell, and Pay your power bill before the lights go out and your empire collapses. It\u2019s basic micro-nomics \ud83d\udcb0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921590/extras/a27ce70361e61c8e7ccd1b1684cb6dfc.poster.avif?t=1770592440\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921590/extras/a27ce70361e61c8e7ccd1b1684cb6dfc.webm?t=1770592440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921590/extras/a27ce70361e61c8e7ccd1b1684cb6dfc.mp4?t=1770592440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Get your greasy fingers on a Shrink Ray and suddenly, everything fits into your microwave \ud83e\udd14 The bigger, the better, and probably more questionable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf64Just about anything is shrinkable! \ud83e\udee1</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921590/extras/60d47a847e6bdd666c8e7a09c3cbaef2.poster.avif?t=1770592440\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921590/extras/60d47a847e6bdd666c8e7a09c3cbaef2.webm?t=1770592440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921590/extras/60d47a847e6bdd666c8e7a09c3cbaef2.mp4?t=1770592440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every empire is fragile. Spend too much on the wrong \u201cingredients,\u201d and you might be watching your profits literally go up in smoke. Managing resources, buying wisely, and keeping a steady flow of income is the only way to stay in business. Some items will pay off big, others will blow up\u00a0\ud83d\udca5 in your face! And not always figuratively!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Beware of the weapons lying around the house. They're not toys!\u00a0\ud83e\udd0c\ud83c\udffe Definitely don't microwave them!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Microwave Simulator:</strong> where cozy, creepy, and absurd collide. A true AAAAAAAAAA experience!\ud83d\ude05</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2921590?t=1770592440","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2921590?t=1770592440","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921590/6a17cedb2911f92f3bf3857775b78517e36eb76a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770592440","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921590/6a17cedb2911f92f3bf3857775b78517e36eb76a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770592440","categories":[{"